title: "Harnessing Endocytosis with Viral Display to Select Highly Developable, Internalizing Antibodies for Precision Therapy and Delivery"
abstract: "Transcriptomic comparison (TCGA + GTEx) of candidate internalizing-arm targets (CDCP1, MET, EphA2) against conventional fast-internalizing uptake receptors used for eTPD and targeted delivery."
